Transistor-level TIA private fixture
*==============================================================================
* Differential TIA with dual VGA, AGC, peak detector (flattened transistor-level)
* Compatible with LTspice and Ngspice 46
* External pins: vcc mc mgc oa inp inn
*==============================================================================


* Weak holds for open external pins (testbench overrides)
Rh_vcc vcc 0 100G
Rh_mc  mc 0 100G
Rh_mgc mgc 0 100G
Rh_oa  oa 0 100G
Rh_inp inp 0 100G
Rh_inn inn 0 100G

*==============================================================================
* MASTER BIAS (~0.9 mA unit from 2.0k to diode pair)
*==============================================================================
Rbias_ref vcc bias_df 2.0k
Qbias_a bias_df bias_df 0 QN
Qbias_b bias_df bias_df 0 QN

* MOS gate bias (~0.85 V)
Rnbias vcc nbias 30k
Mnbias nbias nbias 0 0 NMOS W=20u L=2u

* ---- Current sink bank (collectors = sink nodes) ----
* TIA followers ~1.8 mA
Qstia_p1 tia_fs_p bias_df 0 QN
Qstia_p2 tia_fs_p bias_df 0 QN
Qstia_n1 tia_fs_n bias_df 0 QN
Qstia_n2 tia_fs_n bias_df 0 QN

* Interface followers ~1.35 mA
Qsi1p1 if1_s_p bias_df 0 QN
Qsi1p2 if1_s_p bias_df 0 QN
Qsi1p3 if1_s_p bias_df 0 QN
Qsi1n1 if1_s_n bias_df 0 QN
Qsi1n2 if1_s_n bias_df 0 QN
Qsi1n3 if1_s_n bias_df 0 QN
Qsi2p1 if2_s_p bias_df 0 QN
Qsi2p2 if2_s_p bias_df 0 QN
Qsi2p3 if2_s_p bias_df 0 QN
Qsi2n1 if2_s_n bias_df 0 QN
Qsi2n2 if2_s_n bias_df 0 QN
Qsi2n3 if2_s_n bias_df 0 QN
Qsi3p1 if3_s_p bias_df 0 QN
